1. Start
2. Read the number of elements n
3. Read n sorted elements into array A
4. Read the target element data
5. Set l = 0, r = n - 1
6. Repeat steps 7 to 10 while l <= r:
7.     mid = l + (r - l) / 2
8.     If A[mid] == data then:
           Print "Item found at index", mid
           Go to step 12
9.     Else if data < A[mid] then:
           Set r = mid - 1
10.    Else:
           Set l = mid + 1
11. Print "Item not found"
12. Stop
